se integration by parts.\n\n$$\n\\int uv^{\\prime}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=uv-\\int vu^{\\prime}\\,\\mathrm{d}x.\n$$\n\nChoose the linear factor as $u$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =x \\\\ u^{\\prime} & =1 \\\\ v^{\\prime} & =\\operatorname{sec}^{2}(x - 3) \\\\ v & =\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute into the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}uv & =x\\left(\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)\\right) \\\\ \\int vu^{\\prime}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\left(\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)\\right)1\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse $t=\\operatorname{cos}(x - 3)$ and $\\mathrm{d}t=-\\operatorname{sin}(x - 3)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$. Evaluate the remaining integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =x\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}(x - 3)}{\\operatorname{cos}(x - 3)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)+\\int \\frac{1}{t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)+\\ln|t|+C \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{tan}(x - 3)+\\ln|\\operatorname{cos}(x - 3)|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis holds on each interval where $\\operatorname{cos}(x - 3)\\ne0$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186693957 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "21ad0f6c-9008-55e1-8aa8-64aa9c5de2d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 2 x \\operatorname{cot}{(x - 1 )}+2 \\ln{(|{\\operatorname{sin}{(x - 1 )}}| )}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693943} {:answer/id #uuid "311b89f7-97d7-5ce9-b5ed-ddefdbef9834" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 4 x \\operatorname{cot}{(x - 1 )}+2 \\ln{(|{\\operatorname{sin}{(x - 1 )}}| )}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693946} {:answer/id #uuid "6be4ebef-1c4b-5250-9345-68ffd6924a0b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 4 x \\operatorname{cot}{(x - 1 )}- 2 \\ln{(|{\\operatorname{sin}{(x - 1 )}}| )}+C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186693951} {:answer/id #uuid "89303fce-2b35-547a-9890-96851afc1